<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Arabian Fertiliser Co Q1 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Saudi Arabian Fertiliser Co Q1 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p>    Net profit		146.2	  vs    185.3</p>
<p>    Net operating income   96.2	  vs    133.2</p>
<p>    Sales income	    217.4	  vs    247.9</p>
<p>    Sales expense	   109.2	  vs    103.9</p>
<p>    Shareholders' equity  3,434.5	vs    3,297.3</p>
<p>    Assets		    4,052.8	vs    4,248.4</p>
<p>Full Name: The Saudi Arabian Fertiliser Company (SAFCO).</p>
<p>Note - SAFCO is 41 percent owned by Saudi Basic Industries Corp. The rest is held by Saudi investors.</p>
</text>
